"Parses the input text and looks for the delimiter. Separates the parts and stores them as multiple values to destination field" => "Prejde vstupn\xFD text a h\xBEad\xE1 odde\xBEova\xE8. Jednotliv\xE9 \xE8asti oddel\xED a ulo\x9E\xED ich ako viac hodn\xF4t do cie\xBEovej polo\x9Eky", // ai 2026-06

